    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19887" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βῐασ-τικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>forcible, violent</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					921e
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>MA</u>
				703a22
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάγκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.395
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φίλτρον</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				28
			</span></i>; <i>cogent</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ β. [τοῦ
				λογικοῦ</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				7.216a
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				<i>violently,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					EM
					197.11
				</span></i>
			: of a <i>forced</i> construction, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Her.</u>
				p.484B.
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτερον, ἐπιτάττειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					6.7
				</span></i>
			: also, <i>cogently</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδείκνυται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					5.480
				</span></i>
			.</div>
